or duty on \nDecember 24, 2020, for reasons of national security, defense, or other public \nneed.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"85 FR 81337, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 2","sha256":"e0ea04242aa3ff386db7eef3afdc6c6d3fee8357e86df61a0e85164b22105aa8","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2020-12-16/pdf/2020-27807.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13965#sec2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 3. December 24, 2020, shall be considered as falling within the scope \nof Executive Order 11582 of February 11, 1971, and of 5 U.S.C. 5546 and \n6103(b) and other similar statutes insofar as they relate to the pay and \nleave of employees of the United States.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"85 FR 81337, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 3","sha256":"e0ea04242aa3ff386db7eef3afdc6c6d3fee8357e86df61a0e85164b22105aa8","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2020-12-16/pdf/2020-27807.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13965#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 4. The Director of the Office of Personnel Management shall take \nsuch actions as may be necessary to implement this order.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"85 FR 81337, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 4","sha256":"e0ea04242aa3ff386db7eef3afdc6c6d3fee8357e86df61a0e85164b22105aa8","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2020-12-16/pdf/2020-27807.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13965#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) This order shall be implemented consistent \nwith applicable law and subject to the availability of appropriations.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"85 FR 81337, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 5(a)","sha256":"e0ea04242aa3ff386db7eef3afdc6c6d3fee8357e86df61a0e85164b22105aa8","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2020-12-16/pdf/2020-27807.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13965#sec5(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) Nothing in this order shall be construed to impair or otherwise affect: \n(i) the authority granted by law to an executive department or agency, \nor the head thereof; or \n(ii) the functions of the Director of the Office of Management and Budget \nrelating to budgetary, administrative, or legislative proposals. \nVerDate Sep<11>2014 15:47 Dec 15, 2020 Jkt 253250 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\16DEE0.SGM 16DEE0khammond on DSKJM1Z7X2PROD with PRESDOC\n=== PDF page 2 of 2 ===\n81338 Federal Register / Vol. 85, No. 242 / Wednesday, December 16, 2020 / Presidential Documents \n(c) This order is not intended to, and does not, create any right or benefit, \nsubstantive or procedural, enforceable at law or in equity by any party \nagainst the United States, its departments, agencies, or entities, its officers, \nemployees, or agents, or any other person.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"85 FR 81337, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 5(b)","sha256":"e0ea04242aa3ff386db7eef3afdc6c6d3fee8357e86df61a0e85164b22105aa8","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2020-12-16/pdf/2020-27807.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13965#sec5(b)","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"85 FR 81337, PDF pages 1-2","sha256":"e0ea04242aa3ff386db7eef3afdc6c6d3fee8357e86df61a0e85164b22105aa8","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2020-12-16/pdf/2020-27807.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 6 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: whole-order ending not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not closed","DRAFT: later_source_search not recorded (machine searches are proposals only; paste them after judging them adequate and resolving every CONFLICT line)"],"whole_order_end":null,"whole_order_status":"no"},"draft_schema":"eo-c